1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:02,410
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Kyla loves her little sister.

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,270
Her name is Brenda.

3
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:06,790
She is very annoying though.

4
00:00:07,650 --> 00:00:09,830
Brenda talks way too much.

5
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,650
She talks very loudly too.

6
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,950
Kyla had an idea.

7
00:00:15,910 --> 00:00:18,070
Let's play the quiet game.

8
00:00:18,690 --> 00:00:21,450
I bet you can win, Kyla said.

9
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:25,210
I totally can, Brenda said.

10
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:28,310
Brenda was surprisingly good at the game.

11
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:32,250
She did not talk for an entire day.

12
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,430
Kyla was happy.

13
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:38,110
However, Brenda continued playing the next day.

14
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,230
Kyla missed hearing her sister's voice.

15
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:44,310
Brenda even played the quiet game at school.

16
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:47,150
Her teachers were mad that Brenda was not

17
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:48,590
participating in class.

18
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:52,370
You win, Brenda, Kyla said.
